     It is true.  You're talking about stuff on the second status
line.  Name and rank title are on the first line, and the combination
of name, rank, double digits for all six attributes (or even more with
18/xx strength, and alignment can be too wide to fit.  Level 10-13
monk is "student of stones", and is tied with the next two monk titles
("... of waters" and "... of metals") for the longest rank title.
After that they get a letter shorter ("... of wind" and "... of
fire").
You'll need to gain many levels before it gets back to a significantly
shorter one.  [Originally those long rank titles were even longer; I
think it was "student of the stones", but don't remember for sure.
They got condensed but still don't always fit.]

     You could shave off one letter by changing to lawful instead
of being neutral or chaotic, and that might be just enough to get
everything to fit again.  If that's not enough, abuse your stats
until they drop below 10.  :-)

